  "about": "GET /api/ledger/declaration sources[].columns - each column a source's sentences bind, one row per binding: role key (name = the key part), attribute, time or qualifier (name = the role). entity and predicate are spelled as entities[].type and predicates[].name in the same answer. A constant binds no column and gives no row; a column bound twice gives two rows; a source the loader refused has no columns key. Owner 11-06 tables for people: a key cell is the link to the tables that share that entity.",
